ht: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -48pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - 2024</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">년 전국 대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">재학생 및 휴학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(2024</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">년 신입생 신청 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 48pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -48pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - 만&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">34</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">세 이하 학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(1989</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">년 이후 출생자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 48pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -48pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">지원제외 대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">①&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">만&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">35</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">세 이상 학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(1988</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">년 이전 출생자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">②&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">기졸업자&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">③&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">’24</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">년&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">월 졸업예정자&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">④&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">사회리더 대학생 멘토링&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">회 참여자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">최대&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">회