 letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 48pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -48pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">제출 서류</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 48pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -48pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">필수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">재학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">휴학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">증명서 등&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2024</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">년 신입생은 합격증명서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.9pt; f