/span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -18.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 다양한 분야의 사회지도층 멘토와&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">월&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">회 이상 멘토링 활동</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 18.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -18.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">멘토&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">명과 멘티&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">명 내외 팀단위 활동</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 18.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -18.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - 9</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">개</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: super; font-size: 12pt;\">*</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">